<p>Haye Asghar haye Asghar haye Asghar haye Asghar<br />
Bano ke bain the Ali asghar kidhar gaye</p>

<p>Gurbat me maa ko chowd ke dilbar kidhar gaye <br />
Bano ke bain the Ali asghar kidhar gaye</p>

<p>
1) Asghar e bezabaa'n , dhoonde tum ko ye maa <br />
Ay mere neem jaa'n, kho gaye tum kaha'n <br />
Hai maa tumhari yaad me , muztar kidhar gaye <br />
 Bano ke bain the Ali asghar kidhar gaye.....!</p>

<p>
2) Khaali jhula kiye , goud viraa'n kiye <br />
Maa ko tanha kiye , haye tum chal base <br />
Kaise jiyegi Banu e muztar kidhar gaye<br />
 Bano ke bain the Ali asghar kidhar gaye.....!</p>

<p>
3) Mere shash mahe ko , mujhse cheena gaya<br />
Goud ujdi meri , bas gayi karbala <br />
Sunsaan karke gowd ko dilbar kidhar gaye <br />
 Bano ke bain the Ali asghar kidhar gaye.....!</p>

<p>
4) Mere ghuncha dahan , mere tashna dahan <br />
Ay mere jaano tan , muntazir hai behen <br />
Hai qaima -e- Hussain me , mehshar kidhar gaye<br />
 Bano ke bain the Ali asghar kidhar gaye.....!</p>

<p>
5) Maa ko Armaan tha , ghutniyo tum chale <br />
Khake teere jafa , haye tum chal base<br />
Gham me tumhare roti hai , madar kidhar gaye <br />
 Bano ke bain the Ali asghar kidhar gaye.....!</p>

<p>
6) Lashe Asghar liye , ayengi Fatima<br />
Us ghadi hashr me , hoga mehshar bapa<br />
Kya kya na zulm zahra ke , dil par guzar gaye<br />
 Bano ke bain the Ali asghar kidhar gaye.....!</p>

<p>
7) Hai tamanna meri , shaah ke dilruba <br />
Naseraane aza , pohnche Karbobala <br />
Matam bapa hai shaah ke dilbar kidhar gaye<br />
 Bano ke bain the Ali asghar kidhar gaye.....!</p>

<p>
8) Qabr e besheer par , aayi jab Bibiyaa'n <br />
Kyu'n na mout agayi , maa ki thi yeh fughaa'n<br />
Hyder bapa hai shor ke , Asghar kidhar gaye<br />
</p>
